---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="FAQ | Ruhani Creations by Sumati"
  description="Frequently asked questions about Ruhani Creations by Sumati, including ordering, customization, studio visits, delivery, and design support."
>
  <main class="content-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container page-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
          <h1>Answers for ordering, customization, studio visits, and design support.</h1>
          <p class="page-intro">
            This page is designed to remove friction before you message us. If something is still unclear, the fastest route is the built-in order flow, WhatsApp, or email through the contact page.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-mark-card">
          <img class="page-mark" src="/assets/generated/rcbs-emblem-dark.png" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati emblem">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container page-stack">
      <section class="page-panel faq-layout">
        <aside class="faq-support">
          <p class="eyebrow">Quick Support</p>
          <h3>Before you order</h3>
          <p>Keep your event date, preferred style, size details, and budget range ready. That helps us guide you faster.</p>
          <div class="contact-links">
            <a class="button primary" href="https://wa.me/919105114152" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WhatsApp the studio</a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="/contact">View all channels</a>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item" open>
            <summary>Do you offer custom sizing or fit guidance?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes. Many pieces can be adapted based on size, measurements, and the overall look you want. We confirm what is possible for each design before you place the order.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How do I place an order?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Start from the catalog and use the <strong>Order now</strong> button on any available item. It opens a small window with WhatsApp, email, and Instagram options while carrying the product code and catalog price into the conversation. We then confirm availability, sizing, timelines, and the next step for payment.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Are the discounts on the catalog final?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>The catalog currently uses sample offer presentation so you can see how the original price, savings, and current price will appear. Final order pricing is always confirmed directly with the studio.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can I visit the studio in person?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes. You can visit us at B27, Sarlabagh Extension, DayalBagh, Agra, Uttar Pradesh 282005. Monday to Saturday timings are 10 am to 7:30 pm, and Sunday timings are 10 am to 5:30 pm.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Delivery timelines depend on whether the piece is ready inventory or needs customization. We share the expected timeline before you confirm the order.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do you accept returns or exchanges?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Customized items are generally not returnable unless the delivered item is materially different from the confirmed order. Ready inventory queries are handled case by case after reviewing the product condition and the timing of the request.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Where can I see reviews or latest updates?</summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>You can scan the QR codes on the Contact page, visit our Instagram handle <strong>@ruhani.creations</strong>, or search for <strong>Ruhani Creations by Sumati</strong> on Google Maps.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>